  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>methadone</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>N07BC02</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Shin CW et al. 2024</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>healthy adult ferrets</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>methadone</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_methadone/Methadone_Shin2024_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>systemic clearance (Clss)</td><td>78.9</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>volume of distribution (Vdss)</td><td>9.8</td><td>L kg-1</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr><tr><td>Elimination half-life</td><td>2.0</td><td>hours</td><td><small>t1/2z</small></td></tr><tr><td>SC bioavailability</td><td>1</td><td></td><td><small>Fab</small></td></tr></table><h4>About methadone</h4><p>Methadone is an opioid used to treat opiate dependence and is also used for pain relief. It is an approved medicine, listed as a WHO essential medicine, and is widely used, though it carries a boxed warning.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q179996\">Wikidata Q179996</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Methadone\">Methadone</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Shin CW et al. (2024). Pharmacokinetics of methadone after intravenous and subcutaneous administration in domestic ferrets (Mustela putorius furo). <i>Veterinary anaesthesia and analgesia 51(6):730–737</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.vaa.2024.08.009\">10.1016/j.vaa